-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Adapted material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Lepton is an unofficial adaptation of Quark by Vazkii and the Quark contributors:

  Quark, version 4.1-488 (tag release-4.1-488+1.21.1)
  https://github.com/VazkiiMods/Quark
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0
  Unported (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/

Parts of Quark's behaviour that Lepton reproduces (world generation cluster
shapes and ore pockets, biome and dimension filters, the piston structure
resolver, fuel values, dye recipes) are implemented in Quark's library Zeta,
which Lepton also adapts:

  Zeta, by Vazkii and the Zeta contributors
  https://github.com/VazkiiMods/Zeta
  Licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 Unported

Lepton's code and text were developed with reference to the Quark and Zeta
sources and are adaptations of them. Section 4(b) of CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 permits an
adaptation to be distributed under a later version of that licence with the
same License Elements (Attribution, NonCommercial, ShareAlike); Lepton is
therefore distributed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Changes made in this adaptation:

  - Reimplemented for Minecraft Bedrock Edition as a native LeviLamina mod
    written in C++, instead of a Java mod for Minecraft: Java Edition.
  - Textures, models and other pack assets are new, made for Bedrock data
    formats (resource and behavior packs); the textures are original pixel art
    drawn by the scripts in tools/textures/.
  - Configuration, commands and screens were redesigned for Bedrock (JSON
    config files, Bedrock forms and UI); some modules were changed or left out
    where Bedrock differs (see docs/SPEC.md).

Lepton is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Vazkii, the Quark or
Zeta projects, Mojang Studios or Microsoft. "Quark" is used only to identify the
work this project adapts.

